1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,920
It's often useful to define roles that match the job functions of people within your team.

2
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:16,120
This makes it easier to place users into the right groups quickly and reliably.

3
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:21,360
Burp Suite Enterprise Edition has built-in roles such as Administrator and Scan Initiator.

4
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:24,320
You can also create your own custom roles.

5
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:26,800
There are dependencies between some permissions.

6
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:32,820
For example, to have permission to edit an entity, you also need permission to view the same entity.

7
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:37,460
If this dependency prevents the selection of a permission, the permission is greyed out.

8
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:42,160
To create a new role, log in to Burp Suite Enterprise Edition as an Administrator.

9
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:44,860
From the Team menu, select Roles.

10
00:00:44,860 --> 00:00:46,840
Click New Role.

11
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:49,020
Enter a role name.

12
00:00:49,020 --> 00:00:51,420
Select the required permissions from the tree.

13
00:00:51,420 --> 00:00:53,500
When you're finished, click Save.

14
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:55,720
You can't modify the built-in roles.

15
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:58,520
However, you can modify custom roles.

16
00:00:58,520 --> 00:01:01,520
Again, make sure you're logged in as an Administrator.

17
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:04,320
From the Team menu, select Roles.

18
00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:07,980
From the list, click on the role that you want to modify.

19
00:01:07,980 --> 00:01:09,660
Modify the permissions for the role.

20
00:01:09,660 --> 00:01:11,400
And when you're finished, click Save.

21
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:13,680
You can't delete the built-in roles.

22
00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:17,180
To delete a custom role, access the Team menu.

23
00:01:17,180 --> 00:01:18,500
Select Roles.

24
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:20,680
Find the row for the role that you want to delete.

25
00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:22,880
And click the Delete icon.

26
00:01:22,880 --> 00:01:24,520
At the prompt, click Delete.

